      "common:shortName": [],
      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Polyvinyl acetate is a synthetic resin prepared by the polymerization of vinyl acetate. It serves as the film-forming ingredient in water-based paints and is also used in adhesives. It is most widely used as an emulsion of PVAc polymers in water, formed by polymerization in water of vinyl monomers, predominantly vinyl acetate. It is white to off-white in color and is the familiar 'white glue' used in many households.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "聚醋酸乙烯酯是一种由醋酸乙烯聚合而成的合成树脂。它是水性涂料的成膜成分，也可用于粘合剂。它最广泛的用途是作为 PVAc 聚合物在水中的乳液，由乙烯基单体（主要是醋酸乙烯）在水中聚合而成。它呈白色至类白色，是许多家庭熟悉的 \"白胶\"。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
